  "body": "Wake up to stunning sea views and enjoy the relaxed lifestyle that makes Gulf Harbour so popular. Set on a generous 1888sqm (approx.) site in one of the area’s most sought- after streets, this is a rare chance to secure a premium piece of coastal land.\r\n\r\nPositioned on an elevated site, the section enjoys amazing views across the Hauraki Gulf towards Rangitoto Island. With beautiful sunrises and expansive sea views, this is the kind of outlook people come to Gulf Harbour for.\r\n\r\nThe large land size gives you plenty of flexibility to design and build a home that suits your lifestyle. Whether you are planning a modern coastal retreat or a spacious family home, the setting here offers space, privacy, and an incredible coastal backdrop.\r\n\r\nThe location is another highlight. Gulf Harbour Marina, waterfront cafes, coastal walkways and beautiful beaches are all just minutes away. Shakespear Regional Park is also nearby, offering plenty of opportunities to enjoy the outdoors and natural surroundings.\r\n\r\nAdding even more long-term appeal, the ongoing Penlink project is set to improve future access to SH1, Auckland CBD, and the North Shore, making this popular coastal community even more connected.\r\n\r\nLarge sea-view sections in locations like this are becoming increasingly hard to find.\r\n\r\nSecure your place in one of Gulf Harbour’s most desirable coastal locations and start planning your future by the sea.Contact us today for your private viewing.",
